<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Jensen starts Drypers at buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Jensen starts Drypers at buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Jensen Securities analyst Steven Dietrich started coverage of Drypers Corp on Tuesday with a buy rating.</p>
<p>-- In a research report, he said the diaper producer has stabilized its financial position, added 12 major grocery store accounts, is now firmly profitable and should be able to maintain a double digit top line growth rate and higher earnings ahead.</p>
<p>-- Shares closed at 4-1/2 on Monday.</p>
</text>
